For those that wish to use "audio flash cards" I've made extracts of  
this podcast available at http://ghostgun.com/lojban/jbocradi/ There  
are at least two files for each phrase. The first being in english, the  
latter in lojban. These files are named yyyymmdd_ii_phrase_lll.mp3  
where yyyymmdd is the date, ii is an index to keep things the same  
order as the podcast, phrase is the phrase in english, and lll is a  
three letter language code "eng" equals english while "lbo" equals  
lojban. So for example, "yes" is available as

20050917_03_yes_eng.mp3   "yes"
20050917_03_yes_jbo.mp3   ".i go'i"
20050917_03_yes2_jbo.mp3  "go'i"

there are two copies of some phrases as I didn't know which would be  
preferred. Anyway take a look. Time permitting I may do the next  
podcast as well.

Jeff.

